    "text": "Red Fort Blast Probe: NSG Recovers Red EcoSport SUV Linked To Prime Accused in Faridabad | BREAKING\nIndia\nIn a major breakthrough in the Red Fort blast investigation, the National Security Guard (NSG) recovered a red Ford EcoSport SUV in Faridabad’s Khandawali village, Haryana. The vehicle, registered as DL 10 CK 0458, is believed to be linked to Dr. Umar Un Nabi, the prime accused in the deadly Delhi blast case.The NSG conducted a meticulous search of the area with the help of a sniffer dog squad, aiming to trace any connections between the seized SUV and the explosion. Investigators are closely examining the vehicle for evidence, clues, and potential links to accomplices involved in the attack. n18oc_IndiaNews18 Mobile App - https://onelink.to/desc-youtubeOC CLEAN\nLast Updated: November 13, 2025, 10:39 ISTAdvertisement\nmore Videos\nFollow News18 on Google. Also, play fun Election Games like\nResult Rewindand\nKursi Catcher. Join the fun,\nplay QIK games on News18. Download the\nNews18 Appto stay updated!",
